0 34 186 [
[(Here we use waveshaping to make another form of pulse train. This)]
[(one has a neat spectrum: the partials drop off exponentially \050with)]
[(the "bandwidth" controlling the rate of dropoff.\051 In later patches)]
[(we'll use a wavetable to do the waveshaping but for simplicity,)]
[(it's done algebraically here. The oscillator runs at half the)]
[(fundamental frequency. The symmetry of the waveshaping doubles the)]
[(frequency of the output.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
